These entities will be renamed (My Music Library entity → original ID):

{entities}

The official entities get the `_music_assistant` suffix. Both renames can be undone in each entity's settings.

**Automations and scripts referencing the original IDs** (they will drive the My Music Library entities from now on):

{references}

Standard `media_player.*` actions keep working. Actions of the official integration, such as `music_assistant.play_media`, will no longer work on these entities: replace them with `my_music_library.play_media` or `media_player.play_media`.
